		(uuid "ce47e27f-2c2b-4fd8-9881-6753602d8607")
	)
	(text "F1: RXEF010 PPTC (0.1 A hold, ~0.2 A trip). Supply branch only - never in the TX path.\nD2: P6KE30A (or 36A/51A) used forwards (band towards R8). It blocks C3 from\nfeeding the line during a pulse; reverse voltage then is up to ~18 V.\nR8 limits inrush into C3. Keep it at or below ~50 ohm, or the supply\ncollapses under the buck's constant-power load.\nC3: electrolytic, + towards R8. VRES is ~14-17 V in use.\nU2: set OUT to 5.0 V with the trimmer BEFORE connecting the ESP32.\nR9/R10 let the ESP32 read VRES on GPIO35 (not yet published by the sketch)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 185.42 0)
		(effects
